me isn't on any anything he designed, he takes a deep satisfaction from their success.<br /> <br /> Awakening came gently to Jack. Even he has some trouble determining when the process began. It appeared in his work as a trend toward greater harmony between structure, topography, and community; something that gained earned him a great deal of praise and eventually promotion. One project though, a business district in Shanghai, got away from him. As he began to consider increasingly wide degrees of interaction he reached a point where he saw the whole world in the city and the city in the whole world. When he finished, signing he name not as a mark of ownership but of completion, he looked around and realized he was no longer asleep.<br /> <br /> As Ariadnos, he retains his interest in structure but now concerns himself primarily with the web of ley lines that encircle the planet. He has worked with the Libertines on mapping projects and is one of their most well respecting engineers of resonance. He dreams of finding what he calls the &quot;prime node&quot; that once altered for the better will set off a cascade of resonace that will transform the entire world for the better.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Additional Suggestions:<br /> Merits:<br /> Strongest Attribute: Intelligence<br /> Weakest Attribute: Strength<br /> Strongest Skills: Accademics, Occult, Science/ Empathy, Persuasions /Athletics<br /> Rotes: Prime 4: Ley Flow, Mind 2: Gain Skill</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T17:00:08-08:00","id":393190,"titl